  "bio": "Delve into the mystical art of ink at Coleson Tattoo Studio, your Chattanooga sanctuary for traditional and fineline tattoos. Nestled in the heart of the city, Coleson is a realm where creativity meets legacy, bringing to life timeless designs that tell stories. Embrace the journey to your personal grimoire within an environment where skilled artisans craft tattoos with precision and a touch of enchantment.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Chattanooga, Tennessee, United States"
